<title>USA: Paxson Communications gets OK to buy station.</title>
<headline>Paxson Communications gets OK to buy station.</headline>
<dateline>WEST PALM BEACH, Fla. 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paxson Communications Corp said Monday the Justice Department had completed its investigation into Paxson's holdings and had approved the company's plans to acquire a Florida radio station from Press Broadcasting Co.</p>
<p>The company plans to buy WTKS-FM in Orlando.</p>
<p>Terms of the acquisition were not disclosed.</p>
